  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 10 actions (src/actions.ts) and 9 boolean feedbacks (src/feedback.ts). Both are returned by one function each and registered in src/main.ts:90-91; only the model MODEL_MULTIVIEW4 exists (src/model.ts).",
    "Protocol: a text protocol over TCP (blocks in the style of the Videohub protocol), port 9990 unless the host is given as ip:port (src/main.ts:135). Config: Bonjour device picker or IP (src/config.ts). Commands are blocks such as `CONFIGURATION:\\nSolo enabled: true\\n\\n` and `VIDEO OUTPUT ROUTING:\\n<output> <input>\\n\\n`.",
    "audio and solo route the chosen input to fixed outputs of the model (audio = output 5, solo = output 4, src/model.ts:37-39).",
    "Source quirks kept: every feedback dropdown for true/false and output format defaults to the string '0', which is not one of its choice ids ('true'/'false', or the format ids); only the input feedbacks' default '0' string differs from the numeric input ids 0-3. The set_format action default is '60p', which is also not among the choices (1080i50, 1080i5994, 2160p25, 2160p2997).",
    "output_format compares with `==` against state.configuration.outputFormat; the true/false feedbacks compare against `option === 'true'` (src/feedback.ts).",
    "Default style of all feedbacks: black text (0x000000) on yellow (0xffff00).",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.13.5: options do not support expressions. Variables and presets are not catalogued."
  ]
}
